     "$t": "Ballroom Orchestra - Dance Again (Televen LPS-99516 / Venezuela 1982)"
    },
    "content": {
     "type": "html",
     "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEigHM2is7oNBqzLkLJ1UEDb-AaslwhOc_lM8k5dn6QehO9xJpqlzi-wV7ef-Sub-xwvcKbVP62Dt1Wlxhl6UephLW1gq2SrskOofmtVt-mgJIHrcYahOb_IK_YcFSBigD8dJQOIzJgbLlLD/s1600/blog.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"255\" data-original-width=\"255\" height=\"651\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEigHM2is7oNBqzLkLJ1UEDb-AaslwhOc_lM8k5dn6QehO9xJpqlzi-wV7ef-Sub-xwvcKbVP62Dt1Wlxhl6UephLW1gq2SrskOofmtVt-mgJIHrcYahOb_IK_YcFSBigD8dJQOIzJgbLlLD/w651-h651/blog.jpg\" width=\"651\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"color: #ffd966;\">Ballroom Orchestra - Dance Again (Volver a Bailar) (Televen LPS 99516 / Venezuela 1982)</span></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n01. En el Mood Combinado (In The Medley Mood):</div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <i>De Buen Humor (In The Mood) </i><span style=\"color: #666666;\"><i>(Joe Garland)</i></span></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <i>Boogie Woogie Corneta (Boogie Woogie Bugle Boy)<span style=\"color: #666666;\"> (Don Roye / Hughie Prince)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <i>Bueno, Bueno</i> (Goody, Goody)<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\"> (Johnny Mercer / Matty Malneck)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <i>Pennsylvania 6-5000</i> <i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">(Carl Sigman / Jerry Gray)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <i>Chattanooga Choo Choo</i> <i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">(Mack Gordon / Harry Warren)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n02. En La Acción del Boogie (Bandstand Boogie) <i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">(Bruce Sussman / Barry Manilow / Charles Albertine)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n03. En el Swinging Mood (In The Swinging Mood):</div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <i>El Lado Soleado de la Calle (Sunny Side Of The Street) <span style=\"color: #666666;\">(Dorothy Fields / Jimmy McHugh)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <i>Sentado en la Cima del Mundo (I'm Setting Of Top Of The World) <span style=\"color: #666666;\">(Sam Lewis / Joe Young / Ray Henderson)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<i>No Te Sientes Debajo del Arbol de Manzana (Don't Sit Under The Apple Tree)</i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n<i>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color: #666666;\">&nbsp;(Lew Brown / Sam H. Step / Charles Tobias)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n04. Canta, Canta, Canta (Sing, Sing, Sing) <i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">(Louis Prima)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n05. En el Charleston Mood (In The Charleston Mood):</div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <i>Charleston <span style=\"color: #666666;\">(Cecil Mack / Jimmy Johnson)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <i>No Es Ella Dulce? (Ain't She Sweet?) <span style=\"color: #666666;\">(Jack Yellen / Milton Ager)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <i>El Baile para los Ojos Azules (Five Foot Two Eyes Of Blue)</i>&nbsp;<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">(Sam Lewis / Joe Young / Ray Henderson)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span>Cara de Bebé (Baby Face)<span style=\"color: #666666;\"> (Benny Davis / Harry Akst)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n06. Llévame al Juego de Pelota (Take Me Out To The Ball)<span style=\"color: #666666;\"> (Jacl Norworth / Albert Von Tilzer)</span></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n07. Beguine The Beguine<span style=\"color: #666666;\"> (Cole Porter)</span></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n08. En el Cha Cha Cha Mood (In A Cha Cha Cha Mood):</div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <i>Te Para Dos (Tea For Two) <span style=\"color: #666666;\">(Irving Caesar / Vincent Youmans)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <i>Contonearse (Sway) <span style=\"color: #666666;\">(Norman Gimbel / Pablo Beltrán Ruíz)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <i>Rosado Cerezo y Blanco de Flor de Manzano</i> <i>(Cherry Pink and Apple Blossom White)&nbsp;</i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (Mack David / Louis 'Loiguy' Guglielmi / Jacques Larue)</div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n09. Boogie (Richard Huet / Jerry De Villiers)</div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\">\n10. En el Mood Combinado (In The Medley Mood) Instrumental:</div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<i>De Buen Humor (In The Mood)&nbsp;</i><span style=\"color: #666666;\"><i>(Joe Garland)</i></span></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<i>Boogie Woogie Corneta (Boogie Woogie Bugle Boy)<span style=\"color: #666666;\">&nbsp;(Don Roye / Hughie Prince)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<i>Bueno, Bueno</i>&nbsp;(Goody, Goody)<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">&nbsp;(Johnny Mercer / Matty Malneck)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<i>Pennsylvania 6-5000</i>&nbsp;<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">(Carl Sigman / Jerry Gray)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<i>Chattanooga Choo Choo</i>&nbsp;<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">(Mack Gordon / Harry Warren)</span></i></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\">\n11. Serenta a la Luz de la Luna (Moonlight Serenade) (Gordon Warren)</div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\">\n<span style=\"color: #666666;\">Ballroom Orchestra - In The Medley Mood (1982) / Bandstand Boogie (1982)</span></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<object data=\"http://flash-mp3-player.net/medias/player_mp3_maxi.swf\" height=\"20\" type=\"application/x-shockwave-flash\" width=\"200\">\n    <param name=\"movie\" value=\"https://flash-mp3-player.net/medias/player_mp3_maxi.swf\" />\n    <param name=\"bgcolor\" value=\"#00000\" />\n    <param name=\"FlashVars\" value=\"mp3=https://cldup.com/X55HSZR4oB.mp3&amp;showstop=1&amp;bgcolor=00000\" /> </object>\n\n<br />\n<br />\n<span style=\"color: #666666;\">Ballroom Orchestra - In The Swinging Mood (1982) / Sing, Sing, Sing (1982)</span><br />\n<br />\n<object data=\"http://flash-mp3-player.net/medias/player_mp3_maxi.swf\" height=\"20\" type=\"application/x-shockwave-flash\" width=\"200\">\n    <param name=\"movie\" value=\"https://flash-mp3-player.net/medias/player_mp3_maxi.swf\" />\n    <param name=\"bgcolor\" value=\"#00000\" />\n    <param name=\"FlashVars\" value=\"mp3=https://cldup.com/KjQNNlbBj8.mp3&amp;showstop=1&amp;bgcolor=00000\" /> </object>\n<br />\n<br />\n<span style=\"color: #666666;\">Ballroom Orchestra - In The Charleston Mood (1982) / Take Me Out To The Ball (1982)</span><br />\n<br />\n<object data=\"http://flash-mp3-player.net/medias/player_mp3_maxi.swf\" height=\"20\" type=\"application/x-shockwave-flash\" width=\"200\">\n    <param name=\"movie\" value=\"https://flash-mp3-player.net/medias/player_mp3_maxi.swf\" />\n    <param name=\"bgcolor\" value=\"#00000\" />\n    <param name=\"FlashVars\" value=\"mp3=https://cldup.com/V4J-Rc-jma.mp3&amp;showstop=1&amp;bgcolor=00000\" /> </object>\n<br />\n<br />\n<span style=\"color: #666666;\">Ballroom Orchestra - Beguine The Beguine (1982) / In A Cha Cha Cha Mood (1982)</span><br />\n<br />\n<object data=\"http://flash-mp3-player.net/medias/player_mp3_maxi.swf\" height=\"20\" type=\"application/x-shockwave-flash\" width=\"200\">\n    <param name=\"movie\" value=\"https://flash-mp3-player.net/medias/player_mp3_maxi.swf\" />\n    <param name=\"bgcolor\" value=\"#00000\" />\n    <param name=\"FlashVars\" value=\"mp3=https://cldup.com/ULp7PgLrCc.mp3&amp;showstop=1&amp;bgcolor=00000\" /> </object>\n<br />\n<br />\n<span style=\"color: #666666;\">Ballroom Orchestra - Boogie (1982) / In The Medley Mood (Instrumental) (1982)</span><br />\n<br />\n<object data=\"http://flash-mp3-player.net/medias/player_mp3_maxi.swf\" height=\"20\" type=\"application/x-shockwave-flash\" width=\"200\">\n    <param name=\"movie\" value=\"https://flash-mp3-player.net/medias/player_mp3_maxi.swf\" />\n    <param name=\"bgcolor\" value=\"#00000\" />\n    <param name=\"FlashVars\" value=\"mp3=https://cldup.com/xBw8vPVcup.mp3&amp;showstop=1&amp;bgcolor=00000\" /> </object>\n<br />\n<br />\n<span style=\"color: #666666;\">Ballroom Orchestra - Moonlight Serenade (1982)</span><br />\n<br />\n<object data=\"http://flash-mp3-player.net/medias/player_mp3_maxi.swf\" height=\"20\" type=\"application/x-shockwave-flash\" width=\"200\">\n    <param name=\"movie\" value=\"https://flash-mp3-player.net/medias/player_mp3_maxi.swf\" />\n    <param name=\"bgcolor\" value=\"#00000\" />\n    <param name=\"FlashVars\" value=\"mp3=https://cldup.com/mXmGYH1jql.mp3&amp;showstop=1&amp;bgcolor=00000\" /> </object>\n<br />\n<br />\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">Album \"Ballroom Orchestra - Dance Again\" (Televen)</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">Producción: Andre Di Cesare / Gilbert Morin</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">Arreglos Musicales (Dirección): Jerry De Villiers<br />Arreglos Musicales (Asociado): Roger Gravel / Roger Pilon</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">Ingeniería de Sonido: Philippe Espantoso /Tim Hewlings</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">Coordinación / Percusión / Batería: Ives Lagacé</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">Guitarras: Gilles Pinard / Pierre Girard</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">Piano: Roger Gravel</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">Saxofón / Clarinete: Colin Biggin / Jean Lebrun / Johnny Christie / Léo Perron / Nick Ayoub /&nbsp;</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Pierre A. Daigneault / Richard Baudet</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">Trombón: Albert Devito / Claude Blouin / Jean-Pierre Carpentier / Mohammed Abdul Al Khabyyr</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">Trompeta: Dennis Lagacé / Gilles Laflamme / Léo Desmarchais / Roger Walls</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">Coros: Margo McKinnon / René Lacourse</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">Diseño Gráfico / Ilustración: Studio Grahidée Inc.<br />Promoción: Les Productions Gilbert Morin Inc.</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">Grabado en Quebec Sound Studio (Canadá)</span></i><br />\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\"><br /></span></i>\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\">Hecho en Venezuela por El Plalcio de la Música, S.A.</span></i><br />\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #666666;\"><i>Los álbumes publicados en \"Hippito y sus chaarritas...!\" no deben ser considerados como sustitutos de los originales, son editados únicamente con el objeto de compilar y divulgar en principio la labor de los intérpretes, musicos y compositores nacionales y enmarcado en el estudio de \"El Pop Rock Venezolano\"</i></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #666666;\"><i>Apoyemos a nuestros artistas y a la industria discográfica venezolana, compra todo lo que puedas y así contribuirás a combatir en buena medida la piratería discográfica.</i></span><br />\n<div style=\"text-align: start;\">\n<i><span style=\"color: #ffe599;\">______________________________________________________________________________________________</span></i></div>\n<div>\n<i><span style=\"color: #666666;\"><br /></span></i>Hippito&nbsp;y sus chatarritas...! agradece tu visita y te invita a inscribirte como seguidor de este blog e igualmente a realizar un comentario. No presentamos ni compartimos vínculos (links) para descargas de los temas y álbumes. Para cualquier información puedes escribirnos un e-mail a hippito@gmail.com.</div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"color: #ffe599;\">___________________________________________